# Representation edge cases — local code + value-type override + multiline layout
library "Representation Edge Cases".

terminology "Serum Potassium VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/labs/ValueSet/potassium`.

terminology "Serum Potassium Categorical VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/labs/ValueSet/potassium-categorical`.

// Exercises the grammar corners:
//   - a local code (`- code is`; system = the package's local domain)
//   - a base `coded from` (external source) alongside the local code
//   - a representation that OVERRIDES value type (base Quantity; categorical source is CodeableConcept)
//   - the MULTILINE `possible representation:` form (layout-equivalent to the one-line form)
concept "Serum Potassium":
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity.
- code is `serum-potassium`.
- coded from "Serum Potassium VS".
- source representation:
  - type is Observation.
  - value element is Observation.value.
  - value type is CodeableConcept.
  - coded from "Serum Potassium Categorical VS".
